<title>HONG KONG: S.A.S. Dragon 1996 net loss HK$36.77 mln.</title>
<headline>S.A.S. Dragon 1996 net loss HK$36.77 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   12.82 loss vs  9.00 gain (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  1.2</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  5.35 loss  vs  3.20 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    36.77 loss vs  23.28 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     554.26     vs  577.78</p>
<p>    Company name		 S.A.S. Dragon Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 23-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - S.A.S. Dragon is an electronic components and fashion distributor and retailer.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$4.05 million on write-off of fixed assets in connection with closure and relocation of selected retail shops, loss of HK$0.91 million on disposal of listed investment and loss of HK$0.4 million from deficit in the revaluation of investment properties.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings has been adjusted for the rights issue made in December 12, 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs 2.7 H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
